{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rce4GzfDj6ZxpuX4iGR64i","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# The starter game's level: a room file (every field: rooms/_template.toml). Column = x (east),\n2\t# row = z (south), 1 cell = 1 m. `o` cells are shards and `P` is the start (legend markers,\n3\t# read by starter.rs with `scenes::markers`); the slimes are [[npc]] entries the game drives.\n4\t# Check it with `pav room_check path=crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml`.\n5\t\n6\tname = \"Starter\"\n7\tabout = \"Collect every shard while slimes chase you.\"\n8\tentrance = { at = [8, 12], facing = \"south\" }   # required by the format; the `P` marker is the start\n9\t\n10\t# The rules' numbers (starter.rs `Rules`). Running from the repository, `pav` reads this file at\n11\t# each `load`: edit, then `load scene=starter` or `play bot=true seeds=10`, no rebuild.\n12\t[game]\n13\tlives = 3\n14\tslime_speed = 0.5\n15\tslime_sight = 9.0\n16\tcatch = 0.8\n17\tpick = 0.9\n18\tgrace = 2.0\n19\t\n20\t[camera]\n21\ttilt = 58.0\n22\tdistance = 17.0\n23\t\n24\t[layout]\n25\torigin = [-9.0, 0.0, -6.5]\n26\t\n27\t[[layout.layer]]\n28\ty = 0\n29\tmap = '''\n30\t##################\n31\t#o......#.......o#\n32\t#.......#........#\n33\t#..##.......##...#\n34\t#..#.........#...#\n35\t#.......o........#\n36\t#....#.....#.....#\n37\t#.......P........#\n38\t#..#.........#...#\n39\t#..##.......##...#\n40\t#.......#........#\n41\t#o......#.......o#\n42\t##################\n43\t'''\n44\t\n45\t[layout.legend.'.']\n46\tblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\n47\t\n48\t[layout.legend.'#']\n49\tblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }, { y0 = 0, y1 = 1.2, color = \"#8a6f9e\", rounded = true }]\n50\t\n51\t[layout.legend.'o']\n52\tblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\n53\tmarker = \"shard\"\n54\t\n55\t[layout.legend.'P']\n56\tblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\n57\tmarker = \"player\"\n58\t\n59\t[[npc]]\n60\tname = \"slime\"\n61\tkind = \"blob\"\n62\tpos = [12.5, 0, 2.5]\n63\tlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n64\t\n65\t[[npc]]\n66\tname = \"slime\"\n67\tkind = \"blob\"\n68\tpos = [5.5, 0, 10.5]\n69\tlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n70\t\n71\t[[npc]]\n72\tname = \"slime\"\n73\tkind = \"blob\"\n74\tpos = [15.5, 0, 7.5]\n75\tlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b664ff9f-3df3-486c-8cc6-7a0b3ccfba7c","uuid":"ff4d321e-80a0-4d42-89c2-e2864330b17b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:23:33.046Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211926__x6e380e/work/.research/shardfall/repo/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml","content":"# The starter game's level: a room file (every field: rooms/_template.toml). Column = x (east),\n# row = z (south), 1 cell = 1 m. `o` cells are shards and `P` is the start (legend markers,\n# read by starter.rs with `scenes::markers`); the slimes are [[npc]] entries the game drives.\n# Check it with `pav room_check path=crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml`.\n\nname = \"Starter\"\nabout = \"Collect every shard while slimes chase you.\"\nentrance = { at = [8, 12], facing = \"south\" }   # required by the format; the `P` marker is the start\n\n# The rules' numbers (starter.rs `Rules`). Running from the repository, `pav` reads this file at\n# each `load`: edit, then `load scene=starter` or `play bot=true seeds=10`, no rebuild.\n[game]\nlives = 3\nslime_speed = 0.5\nslime_sight = 9.0\ncatch = 0.8\npick = 0.9\ngrace = 2.0\n\n[camera]\ntilt = 58.0\ndistance = 17.0\n\n[layout]\norigin = [-9.0, 0.0, -6.5]\n\n[[layout.layer]]\ny = 0\nmap = '''\n##################\n#o......#.......o#\n#.......#........#\n#..##.......##...#\n#..#.........#...#\n#.......o........#\n#....#.....#.....#\n#.......P........#\n#..#.........#...#\n#..##.......##...#\n#.......#........#\n#o......#.......o#\n##################\n'''\n\n[layout.legend.'.']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\n\n[layout.legend.'#']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }, { y0 = 0, y1 = 1.2, color = \"#8a6f9e\", rounded = true }]\n\n[layout.legend.'o']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\nmarker = \"shard\"\n\n[layout.legend.'P']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\nmarker = \"player\"\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [12.5, 0, 2.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [5.5, 0, 10.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [15.5, 0, 7.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n","numLines":76,"startLine":1,"totalLines":76}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Rce4GzfDj6ZxpuX4iGR64i","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
