ched\":3,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/core/tent\",\"town\",\"226x212x365\",\"standard\",0,774,\"tent camp canvas shelter\",\"A canvas A-frame tent: door flap on +z, poles…\"],[\"LIB/core/tent_stall\",\"town\",\"280x294x280\",\"standard\",0,647,\"stall tent pavilion market\",\"A round market pavilion: a cone roof in…\"],[\"LIB/core/canopy_stall\",\"town\",\"220x230x171\",\"standard\",0,580,\"stall canopy te\n== assets find=oil\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"matched\":1,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/core/hand_lantern\",\"lighting\",\"14x31x14\",\"standard\",0,517,\"lantern lamp light oil_lamp\",\"A small carried lantern: a glowing…\"]]}\n\n== assets find=drum\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"matched\":1,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/core/column_broken\",\"architecture\",\"255x169x167\",\"standard\",0,604,\"column pillar ruin broken\",\"A snapped stone column…\"]]}\n\n== assets find=barrel\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"matched\":6,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/core/barrel\",\"container\",\"60x91x60\",\"standard\",0,486,\"barrel wood storage cargo\",\"An oak barrel of upright staves bound by…\"],[\"LIB/kenney_mini_dungeon/barrel\",\"container\",\"115x104x115\",\"disk\",0,310,\"barrel cask keg wood\",\"A squat wooden barrel banded in…\"],[\"LIB/quaternius_medieval_village/barrel\",\"container\",\"47x61x48\",\"disk\",42,698,\"b\n== assets find=radio\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"nearest\":[[\"BUILTIN/crate\",\"container\",\"126x120x130\",\"standard\",0,242,\"wood box storage cargo\",\"A wooden crate with dark edge bands and…\"],[\"LIB/core/anvil\",\"tool\",\"64x79x48\",\"standard\",0,266,\"anvil smithy forge iron\",\"A blacksmith's iron anvil with a tapered horn, set…\"],[\"LIB/core/axe\",\"weapon\",\"29x86x5\",\"standard\",0,394,\"axe weapon iron wood @grip\",\"A bearded\n== assets find=tower\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"matched\":1,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/quaternius_medieval_village/bell\",\"town\",\"188x220x188\",\"checked\",0,301,\"bell brass tower church\",\"A large brass bell with a…\"]]}\n\n== assets find=fence\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"matched\":2,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/core/fence\",\"town\",\"216x115x16\",\"standard\",0,285,\"fence wood rail town\",\"A 2 m post-and-rail fence segment; end posts sit on…\"],[\"LIB/quaternius_medieval_village/fence\",\"architecture\",\"238x98x7.8\",\"disk\",0,288,\"fence village\",\"\"]]}\n\n# Object Studio\n\nObjects (props) are JSON documents of named parts. A command is one line, `tool key=value ...`\nor `{\"tool\":\"…\",\"args\":{…}}`; keep it on that line, document and all: a line break splits it\ninto broken commands.\n\n## The loop\n\n1. `assets find=words` finds a starting point: templates (BUILTIN/box, crate, bench, lantern),\n   library packs (LIB/pack/name, read-only: copy one; imported packs: docs/ASSET_IMPORT.md) and\n   saved objects (WORKSHOP/name). Rows are name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc, best first\n   (tier: standard, checked or disk; mesh: % read-only mesh); a miss says `none` with a route;\n   filters `category=`, `tags=` (`@sit`: a socket), `tier=standard` (what every build has),\n   `similar=NAME`; `next` pages.\n2. Make the object and look at it in one go: a create command like the one below and, on the\n   next line, `asset_preview name=x views=true figure=true`. The create reply has size_cm and\n   check (what is wrong); the preview writes a sheet of four views beside a 1.8 m figure, the\n   image to look at (the reply's path; no capture needed).\n3. If the check or the sheet shows a fault, fix it in one more go: a patch (below) and a new\n   sheet. Otherwise stop; the first go is often the whole job.\n\n## A document\n\n```json\n{\"tool\":\"asset_edit\",\"args\":{\"action\":\"create\",\"name\":\"bench\",\"asset\":{\"format\":2,\"name\":\"bench\",\"unit\":\"cm\",\"description\":\"A wooden bench, its backrest leaning on the rear legs.\",\"materials\":{\"wood\":{\"color\":\"#bc8150\"},\"wood_dark\":{\"color\":\"#594635\"}},\"parts\":{\"seat\":{\"type\":\"rounded_box\",\"size\":[220,18,76],\"radius\":2.5,\"pos\":[0,80,0],\"mat\":\"wood\"},\"backrest\":{\"type\":\"rounded_box\",\"size\":[220,8],\"radius\":2.5,\"from\":[0,92,-38],\"to\":[0,141,-48],\"mat\":\"wood\"},\"leg_front\":{\"type\":\"box\",\"size\":[10,8],\"from\":[85,0,25],\"to\":[85,71,25],\"mat\":\"wood_dark\",\"mirror\":\"x\"},\"leg_back\":{\"type\":\"box\",\"size\":[10,8],\"from\":[85,1,-26],\"to\":[85,141,-56],\"mat\":\"wood_dark\",\"mirror\":\"x\"},\"crossbar\":{\"type\":\"box\",\"size\":[6,6],\"from\":[-80,31,-33],\"to\":[80,31,-33],\"mat\":\"wood_dark\"}},\"sockets\":{\"sit\":{\"pos\":[0,89,4]}}}}}\n```\n\nCentimetres; x right, y up, z forward (+z is the front); the origin is on the floor under the\ncentre. Part names: lowercase letters, digits, _ and -.\n\n- **Place** a part by pos (its centre); by from/to, the visible ends of a box, rounded_box,\n  cylinder, cone, tube or capsule (they set its length: a box takes size [across, thick]); or by\n  attach:\"seat\" (on its top; {\"to\":\"seat\",\"at\":\"front\"}: top, bottom, front, back, left, right)\n  plus offset. yaw, pitch, roll: degrees about y, x, z; +yaw turns +z toward +x, +pitch tips +z\n  down. Round parts stand along y; axis:\"x\" lays one along x.\n- **Shapes** (type; full sizes): box size; rounded_box size, radius (at most half the thinnest\n  side); sphere radius; ellipsoid size; cylinder radius, height; cone radius, radius_end, height;\n  capsule radius, height; tube radius, thickness, height; torus radius, minor_radius; wedge size,\n  peak (-1 back … 1 front, 0 a gable); lathe profile [[r,y],…]; extrude points [[x,y],…],\n  depth. arc (degrees) keeps part of a round shape, its middle toward facing (x, y, z, -x, -y,\n  -z).\n- **Colour.** Each part needs color (#rrggbb or a role: $floor $floor2 $wall $pillar $accent\n  $light) or mat: a key in materials ({color, look, emissive}, or a patterned library material\n  such as \"MAT/oak_planks\"), or a library name itself. Patterns, the library and your own\n  materials: docs/MATERIALS.md. look: cel (default), flat, lit, unlit, cutout. emissive 0-32\n  glows; above 0.5 it lights the room.\n- **Groups.** parts:{…} in a node makes a group: its children sit in its frame and inherit mat,\n  color, look, emissive and solid.\n- **Copies.** mirror:\"x\" (or [\"x\",\"z\"]) adds the reflection; array:{count, step:[x,y,z]} a row;\n  grid:{count:[a,b], step:[sa,sb]} a floor grid (plane:\"xy\": a wall); radial:{count, radius} a\n143:## Library assets in game code\n144-\n145-A game that keeps its own state draws an asset for a unit or a piece of scenery each frame with\n146-one call, in its view code while the frame's scene is built (as `pav_view/src/arpg.rs` draws\n147-Shardfall):\n148-\n149-```rust\n150-use pav_view::assets::{emit_asset, Palette, Placement};\n151-let at = Placement::at(unit.pos).yaw(unit.heading_deg).id(unit.id); // .scale(1.5), .rot(quat)\n152-emit_asset(scene, \"BUILTIN/crate\", at, unit.id % 8, &Palette::new())?; // any name assets lists\n153-```\n154-\n155-It draws what a placed copy draws (parts, glow, lights; not `fx` particles). The seed picks the\n156-variant (0 as authored; keep to a few seeds per asset); the palette colours `$roles`\n157-({\"$wall\":\"#5a6b7c\"}); `id` keeps each unit's outline its own. Unknown names fail with the\n158-nearest one. Units need no physics: the game owns their positions.\n159-\n160-Characters use sockets through their looks and room data: a biped's\n161-`weapon = { kind = \"staff\", asset = \"LIB/core/mage_staff\" }` holds the object by its grip socket\n162-(+y along the weapon; the kind still sets reach and swings), and a room performer with\n163-`seat = \"<object>\"` sits on that object's sit socket (rooms/library_hall.toml). A room object's\n164-`patch = [ops]` places a one-off variant of an embedded asset (rooms/limits.toml).\n165-\n166-Scenery that never moves can instead be baked into the level's static regions\n167-(`statics::StaticProp`: no entity, one collider box, ~75 B in a snapshot); Shardfall dresses\n168-its rooms this way from `game/props.toml` (docs/GAME.md, \"Dressing\").","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b664ff9f-3df3-486c-8cc6-7a0b3ccfba7c","uuid":"560f042d-88a6-49b1-b2ef-9ac983a5179a","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:30:28.046Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"== assets find=truck\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"nearest\":[[\"LIB/core/sack\",\"container\",\"58x74x58\",\"standard\",0,355,\"sack grain burlap storage\",\"A plump burlap grain sack, its floppy neck…\"],[\"LIB/core/trough\",\"container\",\"180x54x64\",\"standard\",0,499,\"trough water manger feed\",\"A plank water trough on four short legs…\"],[\"LIB/kenney_mini_dungeon/rocks\",\"rock\",\"220x110x220\",\"checked\",0,362,\"rocks boulder stone \n== assets find=jeep\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"nearest\":[[\"LIB/core/axe\",\"weapon\",\"29x86x5\",\"standard\",0,394,\"axe weapon iron wood @grip\",\"A bearded war axe standing on its haft end: an…\"],[\"LIB/core/tent\",\"town\",\"226x212x365\",\"standard\",0,774,\"tent camp canvas shelter\",\"A canvas A-frame tent: door flap on +z, poles…\"],[\"LIB/core/well\",\"town\",\"178x252x148\",\"standard\",0,718,\"well water stone town\",\"A round co\n== assets find=car\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"matched\":6,\"rows\":[[\"LIB/quaternius_medieval_village/cart\",\"town\",\"139x239x279\",\"disk\",22,2355,\"cart village\",\"\"],[\"BUILTIN/crate\",\"container\",\"126x120x130\",\"standard\",0,242,\"wood box storage cargo\",\"A wooden crate with dark edge bands and…\"],[\"LIB/core/sack\",\"container\",\"58x74x58\",\"standard\",0,355,\"sack grain burlap storage\",\"A plump burlap grain sack, its floppy\n== assets find=gun\n{\"cols\":\"name cat size_cm tier mesh tok tags desc\",\"nearest\":[[\"LIB/core/urn\",\"contai