{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017vnTDNFWhrBh8vchfSnHJw","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"clips\":780,\"library\":1217,\"loaded\":\"100style\",\"sets\":6}\n{\"clips\":[{\"desc\":\"As if holding a rifle and raiding a building\",\"loop\":true,\"name\":\"STYLE100/Swat_Walk\",\"seconds\":1.133,\"tags\":[\"walk\",\"style\"]},{\"desc\":\"Running, swat style: as if holding a rifle and raiding a building\",\"loop\":true,\"name\":\"STYLE100_RUN/Swat_Run\",\"seconds\":0.933,\"tags\":[\"run\",\"style\"]},{\"desc\":\"Standing, swat style: as if holding a rifle and raiding a building\",\"loop\":true,\"name\":\"STYLE100_IDLE/Swat_Idle\",\"seconds\":2.5,\"tags\":[\"idle\",\"style\"]},{\"desc\":\"Walking backward, swat style: as if holding a rifle and raiding a building\",\"loop\":true,\"name\":\"STYLE100_BACK/Swat_WalkBack\",\"seconds\":1.067,\"tags\":[\"walk\",\"back\",\"style\"]},{\"desc\":\"Sidestepping to the left, swat style: as if holding a rifle and raiding a building\",\"loop\":true,\"name\":\"STYLE100_SIDE/Swat_SideLeft\",\"seconds\":1.067,\"tags\":[\"sidestep\",\"left\",\"style\"]},{\"desc\":\"Sidestepping to the right, swat style: as if hold\n162:| `anim_edit` | Create, copy, inspect, change, undo, and redo clips |\n174:| `copy` | `name`, `from` | Copy of an existing `SET/Clip`, with source credits |\n185:Imported sets cannot be overwritten with `anim_edit`; copy the source first.\n193:Use that object with `action=replace` for a complete update. This action retains `src`, `orig`, and `take`.\n194:Use `action=key` for a partial pose update.\n208:Keep the returned `name` to restore the clip with `action=redo` and `if_revision=\"absent\"`.\n218:The source remains unchanged. The copy keeps the original duration and motion within the saved format's precision.\n226:`action=\"pose\"` returns the sampled readable key, joint positions, and body bounds.\n227:`action=\"fit\"` fits the camera to the full animation. `close=true` returns to